  "description": "Lead exception rules EH-BR-RULE-001..015 evaluated at Start Onboarding (and 012-013 at premium capture). Thresholds and per-rule action (parameters.actions.<ruleId>: BLOCK | APPROVAL_REQUIRED) are UNSET: every lead routes to BLOCK / EH-CONFIG-MISSING until the BRD owner configures them (DECISIONS D2, E7). Who may approve an APPROVAL_REQUIRED breach is parameters.approverRoles.<ruleId> - bank roles only (E6); strict seed [BANK_ADMIN] (E9).",
  "source": {
    "document": "docs/au-bank-insurance-platform/requirements/brd-detailed/Exception_Handling_BRD_V1.0_CONTEXT.md",
    "sections": [
      "24.3 rules and rule definitions (column I: block where required configuration is unavailable; column J: remarks mandatory)",
      "24.5 error messages EH-ERR-RULE-001..015 (verbatim, including source spelling)",
      "24.3 EH-BR-MULTI-002 (highest configured treatment wins)",
      "12 approval hierarchy (bank employee hierarchy; block if approver unavailable)",
      "5.2 / 5.3 roles: only the Exception Approver approves or rejects, with mandatory remarks"
    ],
    "decisions": [
      "DECISIONS-2026-10-21 D2",
      "DECISIONS-2026-10-22 E6, E7, E9",
      "ADR-024"
    ]
  },
  "governance": {
    "status": "DRAFT-awaiting-approval",
    "signatureStatus": "AI-DRAFTED - mandatory content-owner approval outstanding (ADR-024 section 7)",
    "contentApprovers": [
      "Exception Handling BRD owner"
    ],
    "approverRole": "PRODUCT_APPROVER",
    "seededBy": "SUG-20261021-rul; approverRoles SUG-20261022-rdy (owner-directed build, ADMIT-BYPASS)",
    "openItems": [
      "D2 owner action: threshold values and per-rule action (BLOCK | APPROVAL_REQUIRED) - all unset, none invented",
      "E6: approverRoles per rule is configuration. Strict seed [BANK_ADMIN] for every rule (E9); which hierarchy level (e.g. BRANCH_MANAGER, BRD section 12 Branch Banking / Banca / Persistency columns) approves which rule awaits the BRD owner. Insurer partner roles must never be listed",
      "BRD section 12 multi-level (ordered) approval and hierarchy-workbook routing are not modelled: one decision by a holder of an approver role releases or rejects the hold",
      "Data sources EH-INT-001..005 (CBS, Equifax, DWH, insurer policy data) behind the inputs",
      "Classification PRODUCT is provisional; owner to confirm whether Compliance must also approve"
    ]
